\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"setcameravideostreamsources 设置需要存储媒体文件的镜头视频源。可设置存储多个镜头视频源。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">setCameraVideoStreamSources</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">设置需要存储媒体文件的镜头视频源。可设置存储多个镜头视频源。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">没有匹配的成员，请尝试更短的关键词。</div></div>\n<h4 id=\"Members\">Members</h4>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getrequestcurrentscreen\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getrequestcurrentscreen_inline\">getRequestCurrentScreen</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getrequestcurrentscreen_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getRequestCurrentScreen</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getRequestCurrentScreen</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.camera</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\"><code>true</code>表示拍照或录制视频时，存储当前实时视频流所产生的媒体文件。你可以通过<code><a href=\"Key_Camera_CameraKey.html#key_camera_cameravideostreamsource\">KeyCameraVideoStreamSource</a></code>获取当前的实时视频流的视频源类型。<br> 注意：<br> 如果是拍照模式，存储的照片为当前镜头视频源的照片，但在红外镜头的分屏模式<code><a href=\"DJIValue.html#value_camera_enum_cameradisplaymode_pip\">PIP</a></code>下为图传的截图。<br> 如果是录像模式，存储的视频为当前镜头图传的画面，非高清视频。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span></code></span></td><td>true表示拍照或录制视频时，存储当前实时视频流所产生的媒体文件。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setrequestcurrentscreen\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setrequestcurrentscreen_inline\">setRequestCurrentScreen</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setrequestcurrentscreen_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>setRequestCurrentScreen</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CameraStreamSettingsInfo</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">setRequestCurrentScreen</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">requestCurrentScreen</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.camera</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">设置在拍照或录制视频时是否存储当前实时视频流所产生的媒体文件。你可以通过<code><a href=\"Key_Camera_CameraKey.html#key_camera_cameravideostreamsource\">KeyCameraVideoStreamSource</a></code>获取当前的实时视频流的视频源类型。 注意：<br> 如果是拍照模式，存储的照片为当前镜头视频源的照片，但在红外镜头的分屏模式<code><a href=\"DJIValue.html#value_camera_enum_cameradisplaymode_pip\">PIP</a></code>下为图传的截图。<br> 如果是录像模式，存储的视频为当前镜头图传的画面，非高清视频。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>requestCurrentScreen</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> </code></span></td><td>true表示拍照或录制视频时存储当前的实时视频流所产生的媒体文件。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"Value_Camera_Struct_MSDKCameraStreamSettings.html#value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CameraStreamSettingsInfo</span></a></code></span></td><td>返回实例。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getcameravideostreamsources\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getcameravideostreamsources_inline\">getCameraVideoStreamSources</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_getcameravideostreamsources_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getCameraVideoStreamSources</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">List</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><span class=\"jv-type\">CameraVideoStreamSourceType</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getCameraVideoStreamSources</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.camera</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取需要存储媒体文件的镜头视频源类型列表。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">List</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><a href=\"DJIValue.html#value_camera_enum_cameravideostreamsourcetype\"><span class=\"jv-type\">CameraVideoStreamSourceType</span></a><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span></code></span></td><td>返回需要存储媒体文件的镜头视频源类型列表。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setcameravideostreamsources\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setcameravideostreamsources_inline\">setCameraVideoStreamSources</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_camera_struct_msdkcamerastreamsettings_setcameravideostreamsources_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card